<div class="marketing-page" data-controller="scroll-reveal">
<%= render 'shared/navbar' %>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="mkt-hero">
  <div class="mkt-inner" style="text-align: center;">
    <span class="mkt-hero__eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: inline-flex;">
      <span class="mkt-hero__eyebrow-dot"></span>
      Our thinking behind Task Days
    </span>
    <h1 class="mkt-hero__title" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);">
      Why we built Task Days
    </h1>
    <p class="mkt-hero__subtitle" style="margin: 0 auto;">
      Because your mind deserves clarity, not clutter.
      No subscriptions. No gatekeepers. No noise. Just your thoughts, organised beautifully.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Manifesto -->
<section class="mkt-section bg-white">
  <div class="mkt-inner--narrow">

    <div class="mkt-manifesto mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item">
      <div>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__icon bg-red-100 text-red-600">
          <%= inline_icon "gift" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mkt-manifesto__title">Try before you own</h2>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__body">
          <p>Most todo apps lock you in immediately - sign up, add your card, hope for the best. We do it differently. Start with a full 7-day trial on our servers, no credit card needed. Use every feature, try every theme, get a genuine feel for whether this is the tool for you.</p>
          <p>After that, you download the app to your device and keep it forever. <strong>Simple lists, no stress.</strong> Most apps overwhelm you with due dates, priority levels, sub-tasks, and notifications. We just ask: what needs to be done today? Write it down. Tick it off. Move on.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mkt-manifesto mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item">
      <div>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__icon bg-orange-100 text-orange-600">
          <%= inline_icon "credit-card" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mkt-manifesto__title">Against subscriptions</h2>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__body">
          <p>£5/month sounds nothing. Until you realise that's £60/year. In three years, you've bought the same app three times. The subscription model is great for software companies. Not so much for you.</p>
          <p>Here, you pay <strong>once - £9.99</strong> - and download the app to your device forever. No monthly surprises. No price increases. No "we're changing our plans" emails. It's yours. That's how software should work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mkt-manifesto mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item">
      <div>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__icon bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-600">
          <%= inline_icon "building-storefront" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mkt-manifesto__title">Against the app store tax</h2>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__body">
          <p>30% fees. Arbitrary rejections. Months-long approvals. Sudden bans. The app store model keeps developers permanently at someone else's mercy - and that cost always gets passed to you.</p>
          <p><strong>We go direct.</strong> Download from us. No gatekeepers. No cut taken. Just the app, at a fair price. And unlike the planner you'd buy at a stationery shop, this one never runs out of pages.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mkt-manifesto mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item">
      <div>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__icon bg-green-100 text-green-600">
          <%= inline_icon "shield-check" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mkt-manifesto__title">For digital sovereignty</h2>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__body">
          <p>After the trial, your data lives on your device. Offline-first, encrypted by default, no servers to depend on. Yours, without condition. If we disappeared tomorrow, you'd lose nothing.</p>
          <p><strong>No noise.</strong> No ads, no nudges, no streaks designed to keep you hooked. The only thing in front of you: your day. What you've done, what you still need to do. Everything else is a distraction.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mkt-manifesto mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item">
      <div>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__icon bg-blue-100 text-blue-600">
          <%= inline_icon "device-phone-mobile" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mkt-manifesto__title">A PWA that stays logged in</h2>
        <div class="mkt-manifesto__body">
          <p>Works seamlessly on your phone, tablet, and desktop as a Progressive Web App. Stays logged in the way YouTube or Spotify does - open it and you're straight in. No constant re-authentication, no friction.</p>
          <p><strong>Privacy-first authentication.</strong> No "Sign in with Google". No "Sign in with Apple". No Facebook. Your data stays yours - not big tech's. Simple email and password with a secure remember-me, and you're done.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- Philosophy -->
<section class="mkt-section mkt-section--cream">
  <div class="mkt-inner">
    <div class="mkt-section-intro mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item">
      <span class="mkt-label">Our philosophy</span>
      <h2 class="mkt-heading">What we believe</h2>
      <p class="mkt-subheading" style="margin: 0 auto;">
        Two things that guide every decision we make building Task Days.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mkt-grid-2" style="max-width: 56rem; margin: 0 auto;">

      <div class="mkt-philosophy mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item" style="--reveal-delay: 0ms">
        <div class="mkt-philosophy__quote">
          "Software should feel like owning a planner, not renting one."
        </div>
        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #4E5C64; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">For people who value ownership</div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <div class="hand-checkbox hand-checkbox-checked mr-3" style="transform: scale(0.8); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4E5C64;">7-day free trial, no card required</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <div class="hand-checkbox hand-checkbox-checked mr-3" style="transform: scale(0.8); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4E5C64;">Download to your device forever</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <div class="hand-checkbox hand-checkbox-checked mr-3" style="transform: scale(0.8); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4E5C64;">No vendor lock-in</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <div class="hand-checkbox hand-checkbox-checked mr-3" style="transform: scale(0.8); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4E5C64;">One-time payment</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mkt-philosophy mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item" style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">
        <div class="mkt-philosophy__quote">
          "Life's too short for complicated task apps."
        </div>
        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #4E5C64; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">For mindful productivity</div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <div class="hand-checkbox hand-checkbox-checked mr-3" style="transform: scale(0.8); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4E5C64;">Minimalist, focused design</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <div class="hand-checkbox hand-checkbox-checked mr-3" style="transform: scale(0.8); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4E5C64;">Focus on today, not a backlog</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <div class="hand-checkbox hand-checkbox-checked mr-3" style="transform: scale(0.8); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4E5C64;">No distractions or notifications</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center">
            <div class="hand-checkbox hand-checkbox-checked mr-3" style="transform: scale(0.8); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4E5C64;">Beautiful simplicity</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Testimonials -->
<section class="mkt-section bg-white">
  <div class="mkt-inner">
    <div class="mkt-section-intro mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item">
      <span class="mkt-label">What people say</span>
      <h2 class="mkt-heading">Real reactions from real users</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mkt-grid-3">

      <div class="mkt-testimonial mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item" style="--reveal-delay: 0ms">
        <div class="mkt-testimonial__stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <p class="mkt-testimonial__quote">
          "Finally, a task app that doesn't overwhelm me. The 7-day trial was perfect — I could really put it through its paces before committing."
        </p>
        <div class="mkt-testimonial__author">Sarah M.</div>
        <div class="mkt-testimonial__role">Designer</div>
      </div>

      <div class="mkt-testimonial mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item" style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <div class="mkt-testimonial__stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <p class="mkt-testimonial__quote">
          "Love that I own my data. Downloaded to my phone and it works offline perfectly. No more subscription anxiety - I paid once and that's that."
        </p>
        <div class="mkt-testimonial__author">Mike R.</div>
        <div class="mkt-testimonial__role">Software Developer</div>
      </div>

      <div class="mkt-testimonial mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms">
        <div class="mkt-testimonial__stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <p class="mkt-testimonial__quote">
          "The minimal style makes it feel personal and calm. It's like having a beautiful planner that never runs out of pages."
        </p>
        <div class="mkt-testimonial__author">Emma L.</div>
        <div class="mkt-testimonial__role">Writer</div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Trust indicators -->
    <div class="mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 3rem;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.625rem; color: #4E5C64; font-size: 0.875rem;">
        <div class="mkt-trust-icon bg-green-100 text-green-600" style="width: 2.25rem; height: 2.25rem; margin: 0; flex-shrink: 0;">
          <%= inline_icon "check-circle" %>
        </div>
        7-day free trial
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.625rem; color: #4E5C64; font-size: 0.875rem;">
        <div class="mkt-trust-icon bg-blue-100 text-blue-600" style="width: 2.25rem; height: 2.25rem; margin: 0; flex-shrink: 0;">
          <%= inline_icon "check-circle" %>
        </div>
        Money-back guarantee
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.625rem; color: #4E5C64; font-size: 0.875rem;">
        <div class="mkt-trust-icon bg-purple-100 text-purple-600" style="width: 2.25rem; height: 2.25rem; margin: 0; flex-shrink: 0;">
          <%= inline_icon "check-circle" %>
        </div>
        No credit card to start
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="mkt-cta mkt-reveal" data-scroll-reveal-target="item">
  <div class="mkt-inner">
    <h2 class="mkt-cta__title">Ready to experience the difference?</h2>
    <p class="mkt-cta__subtitle">
      Try Task Days free for 7 days on our servers. No credit card. Download forever for £9.99 when you're ready.
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <%= link_to signup_path, class: "mkt-btn mkt-btn--white" do %>
        Start your free trial
      <% end %>
      <%= link_to pricing_path, class: "mkt-btn mkt-btn--ghost" do %>
        View pricing
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <p class="mkt-cta__trust">Join thousands who've chosen simplicity over complexity</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%= render 'shared/footer' %>
</div>
